<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<definitions xmlns="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="defs_to_be_04_penilaian" targetNamespace="http://cbt-smk-v2/bpmn/to-be" exporter="CBT SMK v2 Tim To-Be BPMN" exporterVersion="1.0">
  <process id="to_be_04_penilaian" name="To-Be 04 Penilaian dan Koreksi Esai" isExecutable="false">
    <documentation>To-Be 04 — Penilaian dan Koreksi Esai DENGAN aplikasi CBT SMK v2.

Alur: Sistem menilai soal objektif secara otomatis begitu attempt selesai.
Nilai esai disembunyikan sampai koreksi final (siswa tidak melihat nilai
esai parsial). Guru mengoreksi tiap jawaban esai dengan rubrik dan memberi
skor 0 s.d. bobot soal; bila semua esai terkoreksi, sistem menghitung nilai
akhir = jumlah poin semua soal / jumlah bobot semua soal x 100
(proporsional bobot, bukan 50:50 objektif:esai) lalu mengunci nilai final.
Bila perlu remedial, nilai remedial dicatat terpisah (nilai asli tidak
ditimpa) dan nilai yang dipakai adalah nilai tertinggi.

Asumsi: (1) Esai yang belum dikoreksi berstatus belum dinilai, BUKAN 0.
(2) Pengoreksi esai BUKAN pengubah nilai final (SoD). (3) Nilai final
yang terkunci hanya berubah lewat revisi tercatat. (4) Soal kosong
dihitung 0 dan dibedakan dari salah di analisis butir soal; tanda
ragu-ragu tidak memengaruhi nilai.

Fakta aplikasi yang dipakai: nilai akhir = Sigma poin / Sigma bobot x 100,
nilai esai disembunyikan sampai final, remedial memakai nilai tertinggi
(KONTRAK §8.6); koreksi esai manual digabung ke nilai akhir (endpoint
koreksi, KONTRAK §8.4); SoD pengoreksi != pengubah nilai final
(KONTRAK §5.3).</documentation>
    <laneSet id="laneset_to_be_04_penilaian">
      <lane id="lane_0" name="Guru">
        <flowNodeRef>t_koreksi</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_skor</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_semua</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_remedial</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>end_rem</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>end</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
      <lane id="lane_1" name="Sistem (CBT SMK v2)">
        <flowNodeRef>start</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_nilai</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_sembunyi</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>g_esai</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_hitung</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_final</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_remedial</flowNodeRef>
        <flowNodeRef>t_tertinggi</flowNodeRef>
      </lane>
    </laneSet>
    <startEvent id="start" name="Mulai">
      <outgoing>f01</outgoing>
    </startEvent>
    <serviceTask id="t_nilai" name="Nilai Soal Objektif Otomatis">
      <incoming>f01</incoming>
      <outgoing>f02</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_sembunyi" name="Sembunyikan Nilai Esai Sampai Final">
      <incoming>f02</incoming>
      <outgoing>f03</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_esai" name="Ada Soal Esai?">
      <incoming>f03</incoming>
      <outgoing>f04</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f05</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <userTask id="t_koreksi" name="Koreksi Esai dengan Rubrik">
      <incoming>f04</incoming>
      <incoming>f08</incoming>
      <outgoing>f06</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <userTask id="t_skor" name="Input Skor Esai 0 s.d. Bobot">
      <incoming>f06</incoming>
      <outgoing>f07</outgoing>
    </userTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_semua" name="Semua Esai Terkoreksi?">
      <incoming>f07</incoming>
      <outgoing>f08</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f09</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <serviceTask id="t_hitung" name="Hitung Nilai Akhir">
      <incoming>f05</incoming>
      <incoming>f09</incoming>
      <outgoing>f10</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_final" name="Kunci Nilai Final">
      <incoming>f10</incoming>
      <outgoing>f11</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <exclusiveGateway id="g_remedial" name="Perlu Remedial?">
      <incoming>f11</incoming>
      <outgoing>f12</outgoing>
      <outgoing>f15</outgoing>
    </exclusiveGateway>
    <serviceTask id="t_remedial" name="Catat Nilai Remedial Terpisah">
      <incoming>f12</incoming>
      <outgoing>f13</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <serviceTask id="t_tertinggi" name="Ambil Nilai Tertinggi">
      <incoming>f13</incoming>
      <outgoing>f14</outgoing>
    </serviceTask>
    <endEvent id="end_rem" name="Selesai: Nilai Remedial Dicatat">
      <incoming>f14</incoming>
    </endEvent>
    <endEvent id="end" name="Selesai: Nilai Final Terbit">
      <incoming>f15</incoming>
    </endEvent>
    <sequenceFlow id="f01" sourceRef="start" targetRef="t_nilai" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f02" sourceRef="t_nilai" targetRef="t_sembunyi" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f03" sourceRef="t_sembunyi" targetRef="g_esai" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f04" sourceRef="g_esai" targetRef="t_koreksi" name="Ya" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f05" sourceRef="g_esai" targetRef="t_hitung" name="Tidak" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f06" sourceRef="t_koreksi" targetRef="t_skor" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f07" sourceRef="t_skor" targetRef="g_semua" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f08" sourceRef="g_semua" targetRef="t_koreksi" name="Belum" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f09" sourceRef="g_semua" targetRef="t_hitung" name="Ya" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f10" sourceRef="t_hitung" targetRef="t_final" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f11" sourceRef="t_final" targetRef="g_remedial" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f12" sourceRef="g_remedial" targetRef="t_remedial" name="Ya" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f13" sourceRef="t_remedial" targetRef="t_tertinggi" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f14" sourceRef="t_tertinggi" targetRef="end_rem" />
    <sequenceFlow id="f15" sourceRef="g_remedial" targetRef="end" name="Tidak" />
  </process>
